{
  "name": "Inference CNN on MNIST",
  "description": "Classify one digit; needs Train CNN on MNIST run first",
  "gallery": { "section": "quickstart", "order": 2 },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "note-overview",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -570,
        "y": 200
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Run Train CNN on MNIST first: it writes model_weights.pt, and this graph loads it. Trained weights are never shipped with an install, so on a fresh machine this stops at ModelLoader.\n\nSequentialModel rebuilds the architecture the training graph used, layer for layer. A state_dict carries tensors and nothing else, so anything that does not match is a load error rather than a wrong answer.\n\nAfter a run the Print nodes show the raw logits, the softmax probabilities and the predicted digit, which is 7 for the bundled test_digit.png. Point ImageReader at your own image to try another one.\n\n請先跑一次 Train CNN on MNIST：它會寫出 model_weights.pt，這張圖才載得到。安裝檔不會附訓練好的權重，所以在全新的機器上會停在 ModelLoader。\n\nSequentialModel 會逐層重建訓練時用的架構。state_dict 只存張量，所以只要有一層對不上，就是載入失敗，而不是給你一個錯的答案。\n\n跑完之後，Print 會顯示原始 logits、softmax 機率，以及預測的數字；內附的 test_digit.png 應該是 7。把 ImageReader 指到自己的影像就能換一張試。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "start-1",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -420,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 360
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-centre",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 750,
        "y": 190
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Training normalised every image with (x - 0.5) / 0.5, so the model expects values in [-1, 1]; ImageReader hands over [0, 1]. The Add and the ScalarMultiply put that back. Without them the logits are not the ones this model was trained to produce.\n\n訓練時每張影像都做過 (x - 0.5) / 0.5，所以模型預期的範圍是 [-1, 1]，而 ImageReader 給的是 [0, 1]。這裡的 Add 與 ScalarMultiply 把它補回來。少了它們，logits 就不是這個模型訓練時看到的那種。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "centre",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": -290
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "start-1",
      "type": "Start",
      "position": {
        "x": -150,
        "y": 200
      },
      "data": {
        "params": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "model-builder",
      "type": "SequentialModel",
      "position": {
        "x": 50,
        "y": 200
      },
      "data": {
        "params": {
          "layers": "{\"version\":2,\"nodes\":[{\"id\":\"in\",\"type\":\"Input\",\"ports\":[{\"id\":\"p_x\",\"name\":\"x\"}]},{\"id\":\"c1\",\"type\":\"Conv2d\",\"params\":{\"in_channels\":1,\"out_channels\":32,\"kernel_size\":3,\"padding\":1}},{\"id\":\"r1\",\"type\":\"ReLU\"},{\"id\":\"p1\",\"type\":\"MaxPool2d\",\"params\":{\"kernel_size\":2,\"stride\":2}},{\"id\":\"c2\",\"type\":\"Conv2d\",\"params\":{\"in_channels\":32,\"out_channels\":64,\"kernel_size\":3,\"padding\":1}},{\"id\":\"r2\",\"type\":\"ReLU\"},{\"id\":\"p2\",\"type\":\"MaxPool2d\",\"params\":{\"kernel_size\":2,\"stride\":2}},{\"id\":\"f\",\"type\":\"Flatten\"},{\"id\":\"l1\",\"type\":\"Linear\",\"params\":{\"in_features\":3136,\"out_features\":128}},{\"id\":\"r3\",\"type\":\"ReLU\"},{\"id\":\"l2\",\"type\":\"Linear\",\"params\":{\"in_features\":128,\"out_features\":10}},{\"id\":\"out\",\"type\":\"Output\",\"ports\":[{\"id\":\"p_y\",\"name\":\"y\"}]}],\"edges\":[{\"id\":\"e1\",\"source\":\"in\",\"sourceHandle\":\"p_x\",\"target\":\"c1\"},{\"id\":\"e2\",\"source\":\"c1\",\"target\":\"r1\"},{\"id\":\"e3\",\"source\":\"r1\",\"target\":\"p1\"},{\"id\":\"e4\",\"source\":\"p1\",\"target\":\"c2\"},{\"id\":\"e5\",\"source\":\"c2\",\"target\":\"r2\"},{\"id\":\"e6\",\"source\":\"r2\",\"target\":\"p2\"},{\"id\":\"e7\",\"source\":\"p2\",\"target\":\"f\"},{\"id\":\"e8\",\"source\":\"f\",\"target\":\"l1\"},{\"id\":\"e9\",\"source\":\"l1\",\"target\":\"r3\"},{\"id\":\"e10\",\"source\":\"r3\",\"target\":\"l2\"},{\"id\":\"e11\",\"source\":\"l2\",\"target\":\"out\",\"targetHandle\":\"p_y\"}]}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
